  <ul class="mt-4 list-none">
    <li>· Building the next legal OS for modern lawyers at <a href="https://lexroom.ai">Lexroom.ai</a>.</li>
    <li>· Building the OS for modern builders.</li>
    <li>· Shipped: <a href="https://goifc.org">goifc</a>, <a href="https://openblox.sh">openblox</a>, <a href="https://matchblox.sh">matchblox</a> and <a href="https://github.com/Lutherwaves/builder">builder</a>.</li>
    <li>· Learning via <a href="https://github.com/Lutherwaves/lutherskills">lutherskills</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="dim mt-8">Last updated {updated}.</p>
</Terminal>
